                    },
                    "message": "Are PRODUCT_SERIAL_NUMBER and BOARD_SERIAL_NUMBER useful as FRU device description names? A serial like 2334429D69B7 is no more recognizable than UNKNOWN to an operator, and it could be misleading since it looks like a real device name. ?"
